% A semantic predicate answered by an LLM (LE_extensions_proposal §3.6, §4.1).
%
% The same program shape as semantic_match.le, with the service backed by a
% language model: "llm:openai/gpt-oss-120b" is that model on Groq, reached
% with the key in the GROQ_API_KEY environment variable (any model known to
% llm/llm_client.pl works: llm:<model>). The model is shown the template, with
% its slots starred, and the known arguments, and replies with the tuple that
% makes the sentence true plus a one-sentence rationale, which the
% explanation shows ("..., according to service classifier, because ...").
% Each distinct request is made once per session; set the Prolog flag
% le_service_cache_dir to a directory to keep the answers across runs.
%
% No expectations here: the answers depend on a remote model. Without a key
% (or offline) each answer comes back conditional on the open classification.

the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base customs triage includes these services:
    classifier at llm:openai/gpt-oss-120b as a semantic matcher.

the templates are:
    the heading of *a product* is *a heading*.
    the description of *a product* is *a text*; undefined.
    the best heading for *a text* among *a list* is *a heading*; via service classifier.
    *a product* is a seafood preparation.

the knowledge base customs triage includes:

the heading of a product is a heading
    if the description of the product is a text
    and the best heading for the text among [fish fillets, prepared or preserved fish, crustaceans, pasta] is the heading.

a product is a seafood preparation
    if the description of the product is a text
    and the text is semantically similar to "a cooked dish made mainly of fish or shellfish".

scenario shipment is:
    the description of p1 is "frozen breaded cod fillets, fried and ready to heat".
    the description of p2 is "cooked shrimp in garlic sauce, 250 g tray".
    the description of p3 is "dried spaghetti made of durum wheat".

query heading is:
    the heading of which product is which heading.

query seafood is:
    which product is a seafood preparation.
